WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.300
<v Glaucia>What is happening to the Cosmos?

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.000
[Prince barks] Woof, woof!

3
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.500
<v Glaucia>The sensors are going crazy!

4
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.850
<v Glaucia>It is a four-oh-four error in the system!

5
00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.950
[Prince barks] Woof, woof, woof!

6
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.500
<v Glaucia>We have to restart the engines, quick!

7
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.700
<v Glaucia>Don’t touch that!

8
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.300
<v Glaucia>The system is overloading!

9
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.500
<v Glaucia>Try the reset now!

10
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.300
<v Glaucia>Prince, don’t stop!

11
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.400
<v Glaucia>Restart it again!

12
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.000
<v Glaucia>It’s not working!

13
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.600
<v Glaucia>Nothing is working!
